---
import OptimizedImage from "@/components/optimizedImage.astro"
---
<section id="about" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-neutral-50 text-neutral-900 dark:bg-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-100">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(60%_40%_at_50%_0%,rgba(255,255,255,.06),transparent)]"></div>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 sm:py-32">
    <div class="relative">
      <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-10 right-0 select-none text-right font-black leading-[0.78] tracking-tighter text-neutral-900/5 dark:text-neutral-100/5">
        <span class="block text-[18vw]">Developer</span>
        <span class="block -mt-3 text-[18vw]">Designer</span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-8 sm:gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-2xl">
            <OptimizedImage src={import("../../public/photos/IMGA0704_3.webp")} alt="Portrait of me" class="h-auto w-full object-contain grayscale" />
          </figure>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <p class="max-w-2xl text-2xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl">
            Achieving impactful results in UX/UI design, I excel in balancing user needs with business objectives. Eager to innovate further, I aspire for industry recognition in creating accessible, engaging experiences.
          </p>
          <div class="max-w-2xl mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-5">
            <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2 text-sm tracking-widest text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
              <span class="font-mono">( ABOUT ME )</span>
            </div>
            <div class="col-span-2 md:col-span-3 leading-normal text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">
              Creating great web experiences is my primary focus. I ensure each project leaves users
              with a feel-good sensation through meticulous attention to detail and user-centric design
              principles. When I’m not immersed in web development and design, you can find me reconnecting with nature, watching movies, or working on some furniture or a side-project.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>